{"unit_id":"Eileenes__dsh-reel#feature-feature-1","repo":"Eileenes/dsh-reel","commit":"386ca61dcbc7e4453c9e3e8a5c5bc43b6779771f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Reel Studio 的功能「扫描本地插件资料」：reel_scan 接收本地目录，读取 package.json 的名称、版本和简介，检测候选 README 是否存在，并列出指定素材目录中的图片路径。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:15-61"]}
{"unit_id":"Eileenes__dsh-reel#feature-feature-2","repo":"Eileenes/dsh-reel","commit":"386ca61dcbc7e4453c9e3e8a5c5bc43b6779771f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Reel Studio 的功能「生成分镜草案」：reel_plan 根据插件名称、简介和证明数据，返回包含 hook、problem、solution、features、how-to、proof 与 outro 场景的固定帧数分镜。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:65-99"]}
{"unit_id":"Eileenes__dsh-reel#feature-feature-3","repo":"Eileenes/dsh-reel","commit":"386ca61dcbc7e4453c9e3e8a5c5bc43b6779771f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Reel Studio 的功能「渲染视频与宣传图」：reel_render 调用本地 CLI，按案例 JSON 选择视频、图片或两者；视频模式还会导出封面，产物写入 studio/out。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:101-137","scripts/reel.mjs:90-126"]}
{"unit_id":"Eileenes__dsh-reel#feature-feature-4","repo":"Eileenes/dsh-reel","commit":"386ca61dcbc7e4453c9e3e8a5c5bc43b6779771f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Reel Studio 的功能「预检案例参数」：命令行 dry-run 检查案例是否包含插件名称、非空功能列表和宣传地址，写出 props JSON 后跳过渲染。","source":"generated","evidence":["scripts/reel.mjs:16-45"]}
{"unit_id":"Eileenes__dsh-reel#caveat-caveat-1","repo":"Eileenes/dsh-reel","commit":"386ca61dcbc7e4453c9e3e8a5c5bc43b6779771f","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Reel Studio 的宿主工具仍属脚手架：扫描只检查部分 README 文件是否存在，分镜为固定示例文案，扫描与规划结果没有自动串成渲染案例；渲染仍需案例 JSON。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:43-45","lib/index.js:83-97","lib/index.js:125-129"]}
